    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92956.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Hello, and welcome to the Betchessa Podcast. This is Amanda, and I am here today with Representative Debbie Dingle, who serves Michigan's 12th Conditional District. Thank you so much. It is great to be with you on this beautiful afternoon. Beautiful, beautiful. So the first thing I'd love to talk to you about is school re-openings. Something on a lot of people's minds,",
