      },
      {
        "text": "The listener will interpret 'beautiful afternoon' as a positive affective framing of the event.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'Conditional District' refers to a legitimate political district designation within Michigan.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members care about education policy issues like school re-openings.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
