      {
        "text": "Students' basic needs like nutrition are inseparable from their education and overall well-being.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Public trust in schools depends on visible commitment to student care, especially during crises.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Effective crisis response requires both institutional coordination and individual initiative among educators.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Pandemic-related stress diminishes collective optimism unless countered by meaningful action and connection.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Access to reliable broadband is essential for equitable remote learning experiences.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
