    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92956.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, well, that's amazing. Yeah, if anybody knows about finding solutions to problems that don't go away, even if somebody isn't generously offering you solutions, it's teachers. I think that a lot of people equate school re-openings with teachers working again. But from what I've seen the past couple of weeks and even months, these teachers have been working. Correct. They have been working for those kids for months already.",
