      {
        "text": "Political polarization around public health measures undermines effective pandemic response.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Effective leadership requires courage in making unpopular or high-stakes decisions under pressure.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a moral obligation to act decisively when human lives are at stake.",
        "confidence": 0.88
